        <h1>Free Career Tools, <em>No Pay to Download</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">Best Answer Hub gathers the job-search essentials, a resume builder, a cover letter builder, and an ATS keyword matcher, alongside writing tools, into one toolkit that runs in your browser. Real PDF and Word exports, no signup, no watermark, and no subscription.</p>
